Wed Aug 19 00:00:00 UTC 2026 - Lyra OS Release <rodrigo@lyraos.com.br>

- Follow the desktop light or dark appearance instead of painting the
  window dark unconditionally, reading the same
  org.gnome.desktop.interface color-scheme key Vega and Lyra Welcome use.
- Move color-scheme onto :root so native controls and scrollbars stop
  being pinned dark on a light session.
- Own the zypp configuration directories created for the refresh policy so
  the RPM passes the final unpackaged-directory check.
- Normalize Cargo's vendored-source path before archiving so repeated source
  generation produces identical artifacts outside the temporary build path.

